    "annotations":  [
                        {
                            "id":  "ann_1",
                            "type":  "note",
                            "text":  "Generic Script Node — Multi-Output\n\nA family-less scripting node that can produce\nany combination of output types via @output\nannotations.\n\nThis example outputs CHOP + DAT simultaneously.\nUse outputs[0], outputs[1], ... to write to each\noutput port. \u0027op\u0027 is an alias for outputs[0].",
